            <ArticleTitle>[Measurement of the diameter of coronary arteries and coronary stenoses. Presentation of 2 methods].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>615-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This work consists of the presentation of two methods of quantitative coronary angiography: the first is simple to implement, cheap and offers a routine method for a more precise evaluation of stenoses than simple visual estimation. The second is more interesting if one wishes to measure the diameter of coronaries and attain a satisfactory degree of precision compared to semi-automatic methods using image digitalisation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
